    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The name Chicoutimi comes from the Innu word meaning “the end of the deep water.”.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chicoutimi"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Chicoutimi sits where the Saguenay and Chicoutimi rivers meet, a spot that has been a commercial hub since the 20th century.",
